/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 117 0 R
/T (Ransomware is a type of malware that makes files inaccessible by encrypting or modifying them. It can cause data loss by rapidly changing, renaming, or deleting files. Detecting these activities early is important to reduce damage.)
/E (Ransomware is a type of malware that makes files inaccessible by encrypting or modifying them. It can cause data loss by rapidly changing, renaming, or deleting files. Detecting these activities early is important to reduce damage.)
/Pg 12 0 R
