158 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 117 0 R
/T (Traditional security approaches may rely on known malware signatures or detect threats after suspicious activity has already occurred. A behavior-based approach can instead monitor file operations and identify unusual patterns that may indicate ransomware.)
/E (Traditional security approaches may rely on known malware signatures or detect threats after suspicious activity has already occurred. A behavior-based approach can instead monitor file operations and identify unusual patterns that may indicate ransomware.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
159 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 117 0 R
/T (The proposed Android Ransomware Early-Warning System uses a sliding time window and behavior-based detection rules to analyze file modifications, renames, and deletions. It aims to detect suspicious activity quickly, reduce false alarms from normal operations, and terminate the simulated attack process before too many files are affected.)
/E (The proposed Android Ransomware Early-Warning System uses a sliding time window and behavior-based detection rules to analyze file modifications, renames, and deletions. It aims to detect suspicious activity quickly, reduce false alarms from normal operations, and terminate the simulated attack process before too many files are affected.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
