/Title (The proposed Android Ransomware Early-Warning System uses a sliding time window and behavior-based detection rules to analyze file modifications, renames, and deletions. It aims to detect suspicious activity quickly, reduce false alarms from normal operations, and terminate the simulated attack process before too many files are affected.)
